#   MySQL Workbench auto generates a backup copy of the model file on save. Redundant here, in this repo Git already keeps the real .mwb's history, no need to track a second 
#   copy of it.
    *.mwb.bak

#   OS generated clutter, not project files. Thumbs.db and desktop.ini are similar, Windows creates them while browsing folders. .DS_Store never comes from a Window machine 
#   (that's macOS's Finder), but it's kept anyway at near-zero cost, if anyone ever clones this repo on a Mac and browses it, .DS_Store gets created there and would otherwise 
#   land in the shared repo uninvited.
    .DS_Store
    Thumbs.db
    desktop.ini